Native helper binary
--------------------
The native messaging helper (ApiHelper) is NOT included in this repository.
setup-native-host.sh downloads Google's official installer from
dl.google.com over HTTPS and verifies its package signature before
extracting the binary. The helper remains Google's proprietary software and
is governed by its own license terms.
